        "slc_9f0ab2587880d3f66aa50b21e9b9bcd87940ad7c9bceae2ddf1e7e23be11356c"
      ],
      "text": "Debroid is a headless CLI speaking the Java Debug Wire Protocol (JDWP) so AI agents can debug live Android apps via machine-parseable JSON without a GUI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_478ff84156000bcac64e29f8bb9cbd1e51dce4ea4fc4361bc70799b83dbcd7f9",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "90139a0c1ab51df7b704540a221b541d26621649",
          "git_sha": "035cb7030351e3caa61e8d1a71a436034648b79a",
          "line_end": 140,
          "line_start": 137,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "patilshreyas/debroid",
          "url": "https://github.com/PatilShreyas/debroid/blob/90139a0c1ab51df7b704540a221b541d26621649/README.md#L137-L140"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_035c20366e9f954f44db48ee7f65b02bb2d3654e3e1608aa094e44c354f3fb4c"
      ],
      "text": "CLI commands forward requests to a background daemon that auto-starts on first command, holds a long-lived JDWP socket via ADB port forwarding, and returns strict JSON on stdout."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fb8e9a8f8b13e6fb5f0122c22ca2b7d7f1cdc8d6665cd7d1b3c6eafff37237e1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "90139a0c1ab51df7b704540a221b541d26621649",
          "git_sha": "035cb7030351e3caa61e8d1a71a436034648b79a",
          "line_end": 170,
          "line_start": 144,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "patilshreyas/debroid",
          "url": "https://github.com/PatilShreyas/debroid/blob/90139a0c1ab51df7b704540a221b541d26621649/README.md#L144-L170"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f5b0ce78f5546165bff3ba0daca41ca9bac500ca504cacd0664dad8c4ec53ef1"
      ],
      "text": "Commands include daemon, stop, launch, attach, detach, break, remove-break, catch-exception, and others, with global options like --port/DEBROID_PORT, --version, --help, --pretty, and --schema."
    },
    {
