  "summary": "Debroid is a headless CLI speaking the Java Debug Wire Protocol (JDWP) so AI agents can debug live Android apps via machine-parseable JSON without a GUI. CLI commands forward requests to a background daemon that auto-starts on first command, holds a long-lived JDWP socket via ADB port forwarding, and returns strict JSON on stdout.",
